        "change_category": "bug_fix",
        "intent_summary": "Add missing skb_dst_drop in non-NAPI transmit path to properly release dst cache reference before skb is freed.",
        "what": "Added a call to skb_dst_drop(skb) inside the if (!use_napi) block of the start_xmit function, between skb_orphan(skb) and nf_reset_ct(skb).",
        "how": "This change ensures that the destination cache entry associated with the skb is dropped before the skb is potentially freed, preventing reference leaks and potential use-after-free issues in the non-NAPI transmission path."
